Copyright 2026 Miguel Mochizuki and the AnyPoach contributors

AnyPoach started as a fork of Poach (https://github.com/guilopeszw/poach),
released under the Apache License 2.0. It has since been rewritten in Python
and no longer contains that project's source files, with one exception: the
Chrome companion extension in src/anypoach/chrome_extension is adapted from
Poach's Chrome extension (renamed, moved to another port and message names,
and extended), and its icon is a flipped derivative of Poach's logo. Each
adapted file carries a notice of the change. AnyPoach is a derivative work of
Poach. See LICENSE for the license terms.
